STUDENT OUTCOMES (SO) 

After the completion of the program, the graduates of the BSIT major in 
Business Analytics program shall be able to: 

a. understand data management concepts and criticality of data availability 
in order to make reliable business decisions; 
b. demonstrate an understanding of business intelligence, including the 
importance of data gathering, data storing, data analyzing, and accessing 
data; 
c. describe where to look for data in an organization and create required 
reports; 
d. apply different analytics modeling concepts on enterprise data; 
e. understand the functions and data access constraints of various 
departments within an organization and provide compliance reports; 
